# Operators registered by waked for multi-word microWakeWord models.
# This is the single list: the resolver registration and the model
# validator's name check are both generated from it.
#
# Columns: <resolver name> <TFLite builtin operator name>
# The resolver name maps to MicroMutableOpResolver::Add<name>().
CallOnce CALL_ONCE
VarHandle VAR_HANDLE
Reshape RESHAPE
ReadVariable READ_VARIABLE
StridedSlice STRIDED_SLICE
Concatenation CONCATENATION
AssignVariable ASSIGN_VARIABLE
Conv2D CONV_2D
Mul MUL
Add ADD
Mean MEAN
FullyConnected FULLY_CONNECTED
Logistic LOGISTIC
Quantize QUANTIZE
DepthwiseConv2D DEPTHWISE_CONV_2D
AveragePool2D AVERAGE_POOL_2D
MaxPool2D MAX_POOL_2D
Pad PAD
Pack PACK
SplitV SPLIT_V
